    "text": "The locus of the centroid of the triangle formed by any point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> on the hyperbola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>164</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and its foci is",
