  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given hyperbola is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>164</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>164</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Compare the above&nbsp;equation with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Eccentricity, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>We know that, focii are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, focii are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/828dd66d-227a-4e1b-b8ac-5aa60cb0406d-image.png\" style=\"width: 253px; height: 178px;\" /></p><p>Let the centroid be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>)</mo></math> &amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be point on hyperbola</p><p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Put the values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;in the equation<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>144</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So, the locus of the centroid is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
